<title>CANADA: Finning Ltd Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Finning Ltd Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.52		   C$0.44</p>
<p> Net			 20,385		   17,322</p>
<p> Revs		     513,990		  462,059</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.26		   C$2.00</p>
<p> Net			 88,184		   77,493</p>
<p> Revs		   1,874,709		1,751,991</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Earnings per share fully diluted were C$0.51 in 1996 fourth quarter, C$0.44 in 1995 fourth quarter, C$2.18 in 1996 full year and C$1.95 in 1995 full year.</p>
<p>Note: Q4 and 1996 earnings per share include non-recurring gain from property sales of C$0.01 and C$0.19 respectively.</p>
<p>((Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
</text>
